    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d58">

                <pb facs="0122" n="110" sameAs="frus:frus1945v06/pg110"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.85 Lend Lease/8–2945</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The War Shipping Administrator</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Land</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-08-29">August 29,
                        1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Mr. Byrnes</hi>: I am sending you herewith a
                    memorandum on the subject of shipping as affected by international arrangements
                    covering Lend Lease and other fiscal problems, which I hope you will have an
                    opportunity to consider carefully before you leave for London.<anchor n="12"
                        xml:id="d58-f1"/>
                    <pb facs="0123" n="111" xml:id="pg111"/> I have discussed this problem with Leo
                    Crowley and he is in sympathy with our objectives and believes that something
                    should be done, if possible, to protect our interest in the matter as part of
                    the contemplated international agreements with Great Britain and other Allies
                    covering our future economic policy.</p>
                <p>Very sincerely yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>E. S. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Land</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d58-a1.xml" xpointer="d58-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d58-f1" n="12" xml:id="d58-f1-content">
                <p>To attend the first session of the Council of Foreign Ministers.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
